e that every producer/consumer obeys the intended contract.\",\n        \"remaining\": [\n          \"Core formation gap: trace stepLeader proposal handling and append response consumption through tracker quorum aggregation and raftLog commit guards, including retry/reject paths.\",\n          \"Core authority gap: trace campaign, vote aggregation, becomeLeader/becomeFollower and leader-transfer/quorum-loss paths; connect surviving committed log and reset pending state.\",\n          \"Supporting backbone gap: read configuration activation/joint quorum, log conflict and snapshot recovery, unstable stabilization and Ready acceptance/Advance/application completion before judging the overview usable.\",\n          \"Interface wording needs reconciliation before any synchronous harness: doc.go permits same-batch entry persistence overlap with message transmission, while rawnode.go describes Messages as waiting for Entries persistence. Inspect Ready field contracts and actual message partitioning rather than assigning a violation from wording alone.\"\n        ],\n        \"understanding\": \"updated\",\n        \"rationale\": \"Next read the commit and authority consumers plus the persistence completion callees. This distinguishes eligible durable support from merely queued support and connects old-work handling to decisions. No execution, formal obligation or usable overview is claimed.\",\n        \"question_updates\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"executed\",\n    \"operation_id\": \"0ada27cbd895427ba08966862cf7acea\",\n    \"action\": \"research\"\n  },\n  \"latest_decision\": {\n    \"operation_id\": \"0ada27cbd895427ba08966862cf7acea\",\n    \"action\": \"research\",\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"selections\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"operation_id\": \"0ada27cbd895427ba08966862cf7acea\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"stop\": {},\n  \"stop_reason\": \"Not starte